  "details": "When using a menu background with a parallax effect, the parallax will be given incorrect position data when the error tab is opened. I have not verified this in Desktop, only VR.\n\n1. Have a parallax menu background active (I personally use \"Bokeh\")\n\n2. Attempt to join a world that has already hit it's max cap.\n\n3. When the error popup occurs, the cursor position within this error popup is being used for the parallax effect, causing it to spaz out incredibly quickly.\n\nEven after closing through this popup however, it seems only the visuals were removed, as the collider for this error menu still exists until closing your menu, causing the parallax to panic whenever the cursor is on the bottom half of the menu, where the error popup clips through the menu.",
